  "summary": "Runtime WASM per plugin, event bus, contributi alle regioni e action registration.",
  "description": "⚠️ This phase has NO written description yet — the text below is a single cross-reference added\n2026-07-25, not a phase spec. It needs a real discovery pass before planning. Design intent lives in\ndocs/chrome-and-ui.md (the WasmProviderAdapter seam, §2.6.1 B/D/E) for now.\n\n═══ KNOWN OPEN QUESTION THIS PHASE MUST ANSWER ═══\nWhere the plugin-facing builder types live. A plugin gets NO editor completion today because the\ndeclarative model (`ViewNode`, `WidgetKind`, `PropValue`, `Intent`) sits inside the app at\nheca/src/chrome/view.rs, and a plugin cannot depend on the app. The workspace has six members and\nnone is a plugin kit (Cargo.toml:2); the plan never names one.\n\nFull write-up and the reasoning — including why this is NOT the thing AGENTS.md:744 forbids — is in\nF003/P017/T9, deferred there deliberately because this is the phase where it gets decided. It is\nalso attached to T1 of this phase (Design WASM host API facade), which is the task it actually\nblocks: do not design the facade around types a plugin cannot import.",
  "notes": "",
